foundation.question_text:
The equal bars show two fractions.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.65cm,y=0.65cm]
\foreach \i in {0,...,1} {\fill[blue!25] (\i,1.5) rectangle (\i+1,2.5);}
\draw (0,1.5) rectangle (5,2.5);
\foreach \i in {1,...,4} {\draw (\i,1.5)--(\i,2.5);}
\node[left] at (0,2) {A};
\foreach \i in {0,...,3} {\fill[orange!30] (\i,0) rectangle (\i+1,1);}
\draw (0,0) rectangle (5,1);
\foreach \i in {1,...,4} {\draw (\i,0)--(\i,1);}
\node[left] at (0,0.5) {B};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Which fraction is greater?
